  "title": "Spinach and Mushroom Salad",
  "description": "This spinach and mushroom salad recipe combines fresh spinach, crumbled bacon, and sliced mushrooms, topped with a warm and tangy bacon vinaigrette.",
  "authors": [
    "MONIQUET"
  ],
